    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278468</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_001&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>夢か……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>A dream, huh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278548</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_002&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>よーし……がんばっか……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Okay, alright...I'm
gonna give it my all...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278644</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_003&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ずいぶん、はりきっちゃって
どうしたんだか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're in high spirits...
Did something happen?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278712</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_004&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>なんでもねって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nah, nothin' much.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>4</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278780</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_005&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……ねぇ、&lt;Dio&gt;</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...Hey, &lt;Dio&gt;.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>5</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278836</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_006&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ん？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hm?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>278932</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_007&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>本当にわたしたち、
何にでもなれると思う？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you really think
we can become "anything"?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279000</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_008&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>どーゆーこと？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Whaddya mean?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279096</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_009&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>あの人、わたしたちは
真っ白だって言ってた</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>That man said our
futures are "pure white."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279192</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_010&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ああ。だから、
オレらはなんにでも
なれるって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah. And 'cause of
that, we can become
anything we want.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>10</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_011&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>違うよ……
真っ白ってことは、
何もないってことだよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But that's not right... If something
is "pure white," that means it's
blank. So, it's nothing at all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279360</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_012&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>何もない？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Nothing at all?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279488</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_013&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>わたしたち、子どもだよ。
困ってる人探してても
誰も頼りになんてしてくれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We're children. Even when we tried
to find people to help, no one
would trust us, or count on us.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>13</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>279920</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_018&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>魔術使えば暴走させちゃう。
精霊と戦うのも精一杯だし……！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>When I used magic, it went out
of control. We can barely even
manage to fight these spirits...!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280008</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_019&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>こんなんじゃ、
何もできないよ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If we're like this, we
can't do anything at all...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_021&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>……&lt;Mel&gt;、
不安に思うことなんてないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...&lt;Mel&gt;. You don't
need to worry.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_022&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>もし、魔術の暴走が止められたら、
帰ろう、あの家に</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Once we stop that
magic, we can
go back home.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280296</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_023&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>今までどおりに
暮らせばいいんだシ。
でしょ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>We can go right back to
living the way we always
have, until now. Can't we?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>16</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280392</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_024&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ゴメンなさい、エト。
つまんないこと言って</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Sorry, Ethos.
I'm being dumb.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280480</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_025&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;も。今の忘れて。
さぁ、行こう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>To you, too, &lt;Dio&gt;.
Just forget I said
anything. Let's go.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>20</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280568</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_026&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>ずっと不安だったんだよ、
&lt;Mel&gt;は</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You've been worrying
a lot, huh, &lt;Mel&gt;?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>21</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_029&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>オレがやるよ、
魔術の暴走を止めるのだって、
『なりきり士』の仕事だって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I can do it all myself.
I'll stop the magic. I'll
do the "Roleplayer" work.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>280912</PointerOffset>
      <VoiceId>&lt;audio:VSM_080_060_030&gt;</VoiceId>
      <JapaneseText>無理して、
&lt;Mel&gt;も来ることない。
エトだって……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>If you don't wanna
come, &lt;Mel&gt;, then don't.
And same for you, Ethos...</EnglishText>
      <Notes>Not sure if its about feelings of doubt or the magic
---
what is this note even about lol</Notes>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>22</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
